coder › Done on branch `work/done-command` (commit `b160873 add done command and markDone`).

What changed:
- `src/store.ts`: `render` now prints `"<id>. [x] <text>"` for done and `"[ ]"` otherwise; added `markDone(todos, id)` which throws `RangeError("no todo <id>")` when missing and otherwise returns a new array with a copied `{...todo, done: true}` (input array/objects untouched).
- `src/cli.ts`: added `done <id>` — parses `rest[0]` via `Number`, rejects missing/blank/non-integer with `{out: "error: no todo <raw>\n", code: 1}` returning the original `todos` reference; on success returns `{out: "done: <text>\n", todos: next, code: 0}`; unknown-id `RangeError` maps to the same `error:`/code-1 path. Usage line updated to `todo add <text> | list | done <id>`.
- `src/cli.test.ts`: added tests for `markDone` (new list, no mutation, `RangeError` naming id), `done` success, `done` unknown id, `done` non-whole-number ids (`abc`, `1.5`), and `list`/`render` `[x]`/`[ ]` markers.

